fiedEvidence\": [\n      \"Sub-question (b) matches the original page: 1 日に発生する二酸化炭素の重量の値[t]として，最も近いものを…一つ選べ. The common conditions also match: 1 000 MW, 41 %, 44 000 kJ/kg, C 85 %, H 15 %, C=12, O=16.\",\n      \"Choices (1) 9.5×10³, (2) 12.8×10³, (3) 15.0×10³, (4) 17.6×10³, and (5) 28.0×10³ match the original page exactly.\",\n      \"officialAnswer=3 matches the manifest's official answer unit {question:15, part:\\\"b\\\", answer:\\\"3\\\"}.\",\n      \"Recalculation: fuel = 3.6×10⁹/18 040 ≒ 199.56 t/h. Carbon = 199.56×0.85 ≒ 169.62 t/h. CO2 = 169.62×44/12 ≒ 621.9 t/h. Over 24 h this is ≒ 14.93×10³ t, closest to (3) 15.0×10³. The numbers and causal chain in the explanation are correct.\",\n      \"The explanation correctly states that hydrogen becomes H2O and produces no CO2.\",\n      \"No figure is needed. figureUrls=[] is consistent with the original page. The original page footer reads T2-D 018, which matches reviewedFromPage=[18].\",\n      \"officialReferenceUrls=[], so there are no external claims to check.\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18172,"cache_read_input_tokens":140024,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18172},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"931ab809-63c3-4a50-b987-c3846ea05fa7","uuid":"ec802326-bef5-4481-92ef-54556b0960f4","timestamp":"2026-09-24T09:34:15.982Z","request_id":"req_011CfN2wZjKsxqBWbDny9ZfP"}
